ine that knows only HTTP/3 (in VpnHood.Net.Http3's namespace, moved into its own project next) and the server's parts - the proof filter, the tunnel runner and the unauthenticated budget - so a tunnel's error no longer closes its client's other tunnels. The front now answers as Kestrel does to large unknown frames, header and request-line limits, a mixed-case te, paths outside Latin-1 or with %00, the drain after a client's GOAWAY, QPACK's Base and empty names, and trailers. The app checks its clock over TCP only after a QUIC request that got no answer, at most once a minute while that check fails, and no request waits on it (written by Astra; IP-blocking plan item 5.6)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Dolibarr/dolibarr","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T02:26:35Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"3b069e94da821a5e776d39094ad19d493ca33c13","github_link":"https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/commit/3b069e94da821a5e776d39094ad19d493ca33c13","commit_subject":"FIX getRecords() of Ldap truncated to the server MaxPageSize (paged search) (#42414)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"vescon/MethodBoundaryAspect.Fody","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T02:26:14Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"4562e4cad2121d4ad5fb93f50bdd8269b35c1cae","github_link":"https://github.com/vescon/MethodBoundaryAspect.Fody/commit/4562e4cad2121d4ad5fb93f50bdd8269b35c1cae","commit_subject":"Run the test of a generic aspect with a private type argument on .NET Framework as well (T-9)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"DataBiosphere/azul","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T02:26:04Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"c8803d5dc6b8f2d7d585d76a41a5a7469637a293","github_link":"https://github.com/DataBiosphere/azul/commit/c8803d5dc6b8f2d7d585d76a41a5a7469637a293","commit_subject":"[r] Index anvil16 (#8457)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"geoparquet/geoparquet-io","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-31T02:25:52Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"d25736b90484af05e422e584bce0cf302fa23e01","github_link":"https://github.com/geopar